{
  "name": "forest-ash-theme-vscode",
  "displayName": "Forest Ash Theme",
  "description": "21 themes, infinite possibilities, zero cost - A collection of dark and light, eye-friendly VS Code themes inspired by forest ash textures and anime palettes. Features dynamic custom theme generation and multi-tool export to JetBrains, Neovim, Sublime Text, Windows Terminal, iTerm2, Alacritty, Zed, tmux, and Warp.",
